# Tech Updates — Watchlist

## Signals

Short-lived items worth a look but not yet findings. One bullet each:
`- <what> — <why it matters> (first seen: YYYY-MM-DD)`

## Coverage gaps

Topic areas that produced no signal for two or more consecutive runs:

`- <area> — no signal since <YYYY-MM-DD> (runs: <n>)`

## Next watch

Deliberate follow-ups for the next run:

`- <area/source/query to watch> — <what would count as a signal>`

Rules: prune "Signals" into findings or drop them once stale; never delete
"Coverage gaps" entries without either closing them (signal arrived) or
noting why they were withdrawn.
